      "date": "2026-05-20T12:34:30.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹14.90 (vs ₹3.86 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹14.90 (up from ₹3.86 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹8.94b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹527.1m (up 285% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.9% (up from 1.8% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 44% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
